        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ted Tetzlaff, David Siegel, Scott McGehee\n- Roles: cinematographer, film director, screenwriter, producer\n- Places: Los Angeles, California, Sausalito, California\n- Topics: Hollywood, Academy Award nominations, writing-directing-producing teams\n\nFacts:\n- Ted Tetzlaff was born on 3 June 1903 in Los Angeles, California.\n- Ted Tetzlaff was a noted Hollywood cinematographer active in the 1930s and 1940s.\n- Ted Tetzlaff was nominated for an Academy Award.\n- David Siegel is an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- David Siegel has a long-standing writing-directing-producing partnership with filmmaker Scott McGehee.\n- Ted Tetzlaff died on 7 January 1995 in Sausalito, California.",
